      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BETTER SWEET (4) returns after a 16-week spell. Good fresh performer who looked forward in condition when taking out a recent trial. Comes to hand quickly and is a winner here at the trip. Looks the testing material with the help of the inside gate. LADY MILAN (7) ended a string of three minor placings with an effortless maiden win here at this trip last time out, leading from the outset. Sure to take a lot from that success and can go right on with it now. Lightly raced four-year-old SORT CHA MESS (3) has been in the money at all three runs this prep, the latest in a Class 1 over 1000m at the Sunshine Coast. Proven at this sharp journey and should be about the mark again. BOTTLES OF SHELLS (5) opened her account last start with a narrow victory over 860m at Gatton. Progressing well and from a favourable draw should give a good account again. BETTERINDANUDE (1) ran a better race last time out at Gatton. Ready to peak at the third run back.",
